--- !u!114 &1326682839
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1326682836}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3701bfc640c094f71b932990435d2aca, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: NeonRift.HarborRain::NeonRift.HarborRain.HarborRadio
  lines:
  - id: start
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Control to Driver. You're at the south perimeter of Kowloon Bay. Your pass opens the checkpoint. Keep your transponder quiet. We have eyes on the gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ee3529f288724ea3947e8d8dba96784, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: inside
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: You're in. The terminal office is up the spine, left on the terminal road. Manifest kiosk is outside the office.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 67ba11aa328a443cdb14b32fa75b88cd, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: manifest_open
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Pull the manifest. KX-7 is hidden under a cover listing. Match all three clues. We get one clean read.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd46c54d3f63945b29d757002c08dc05, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: manifest_wrong
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Wrong container. The port flagged the query. Read the clues again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9e5502b756a944baf8efec82a035bbd2, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 6
  - id: manifest_r1
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Good read. KX-7 is in restricted bay R-1. Two patrols are working the container lanes.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9362978793384424b89fb1c7c345d13, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: manifest_r2
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Good read. KX-7 is in restricted bay R-2. Two patrols are working the container lanes.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 889bd94b234e6492493bd06d83df7b75, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: manifest_r3
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Good read. KX-7 is in restricted bay R-3. Two patrols are working the container lanes.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e2da9144122df465a8f5c7c3c8f999f0, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: rival
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Overwatch here. Another crew just came in through the freight yard. They're after the same box.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0b04e447e988749d59af4f5dc64dfcf8, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: rival_close
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Rival crew is two hundred metres from the restricted area. Move.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd1006b54754949a799fc10306363b54, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: optional_relay
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: If you have a minute, there's a drone relay on the berth apron. Spike it and their drones go blind for a while.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3e10d3ce331524c07809017da41a99d2, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: relay_done
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Relay's down. Their drones are flying blind for forty-five seconds after the alarm.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6c4da698f69244f93b46b79bb5d40a98, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: gate_open
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Security gate. Run the bypass. Lock each reel when it shows the badge code.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e94119d19722d4cfc9856a7c5969471d, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: gate_fail
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Reader kicked you out. Reset and go again.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f541f79240614d63a36bfddd7a20343, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 8
  - id: gate_ok
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Camera loop is live. You've got a short window before the system notices the feed.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a9c0c2f1f7fa74b388d52cafce29c9aa, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: lock_start
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: That's KX-7. Release the twistlocks, then hold the seal signal steady while the spreader lifts.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 75dad85bacffd4524950cc1914756ec7, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: lock_fail
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Signal dropped. Steady it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dca27067fe85c473fb08dd349ee8cc35, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 8
  - id: theft
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Cargo confirmed. The alarm is live. Port security has your position. Get to the east gate.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 11df6afa2ec3a4d2e90adac4022ab152, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: spotted
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: You've been seen. Break line of sight.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2e408dd87a9a94781a7c7e7a6abceb60, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 25
  - id: alarm_early
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Alarm's up early. The lockdown clock is running. Finish the job, fast.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1075ed925c6a44dc1afe19e375f3f580, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: security_chatter
    speaker: PORT SECURITY
    text: All units, theft in the restricted area. Seal the terminal. Unit four, block the quay road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ec5a0015548f44220bf49f638b4a9d48, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: blockade
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Driver, hold. Drone feed shows a patrol blocking the road ahead. Sending you a new route now.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 71eb02dab5b1e4488ba8ffa0e2bae47c, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: reroute
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: New route on your map. Follow the line.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a1f4c15f5dfc147c690e9891f7a081ae, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 14
  - id: no_route
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Every road east is closed. Push through or wait for the water to drop.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d4ff0686b56c4796b125cac88c75687, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 20
  - id: flood_close
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: The low dock road is going under. Routing you around it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa032b6dc21f642d0a12c54a1a5416d2, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: checkpoint_sealed
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Lane eighty checkpoint just sealed. Routing you around.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7865c114a9cb4a10b1fbee41976ebf7, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: drone_search
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Drone sweep over your sector. Stay under the cranes if you can.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6dd5cdd9371e442c3a78dd8f11ab1d0e, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 30
  - id: drone_lock
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Drone has a lock. That speeds up their lockdown. Get under cover.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d445260f4d847465b9aa6c8ceb3d2479, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 30
  - id: override
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: East gate is in lockdown. Get to the junction box and reroute the power.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ca260a4387bba40db8d9f293148fd482, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: override_fail
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Breaker tripped. Re-route it.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9134e64bc10e4417dae51f86b41cdc47, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 8
  - id: override_ok
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Gate's open. Out onto the coast road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e77a366b5427477a9c52e748ae6d7fe, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: coast
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Storm surge warning. Waves are overtopping the outer seawall. Do not enter the exposed section until the water drops.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: aace8e9ce93034dad88b46199fe20d25, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: bypass
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: If you don't like the sea road, the inland service road is dry. It's longer.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f9c935f85fe584c438676f0cdff10954, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: wave_warn
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Big set rolling in. Hold short of the marked section.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b6c531a7dfe1c4b19ba50cfc6bce8bab, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 18
  - id: wave_clear
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: Water's draining. Go now.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d481ee25ff25047e29cca3821d2c62ab, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 18
  - id: wave_hit
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: You took that wave. Ease off and let the tyres find the road.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 86999404c4bc34831b28ed40fffc633b, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 20
  - id: extraction
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Extraction is open. One clear approach. Bring it home.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 73d10e9e5634d4055beffe41222e79d6, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: extracted
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Cargo's through. Clean work, Driver. Control out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ce2cb0a06e7a944b6bddb4c1c97d2632, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: failed
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: That's lockdown. Abort. We'll find another way out.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 01ec25d5ebfb644fd9376f3c0ff39cd0, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: police_dispatch
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: All units, all units. Cargo theft at the restricted container area. Suspect vehicle leaving the scene. Respond code three.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fc326888a4b0542cc98a149ccd826d6f, type: 3}
    priority: 2
    cooldown: 0
  - id: police_pursuit_east
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Kilo one, in pursuit. Suspect heading east.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3fd52d9b229c4969824fb6407ac26b0, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 25
  - id: police_pursuit_west
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Kilo one, in pursuit. Suspect heading west.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b496ef629a0e401aad403ef6fdd3a2c, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 25
  - id: police_pursuit_north
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Kilo one, in pursuit. Suspect heading north, toward the quay.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6ffdb9bd1698e4265bb1593583a7539e, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 25
  - id: police_pursuit_south
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Kilo one, in pursuit. Suspect heading south.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f7f560c459a894877b19cffbb54e8a4f, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 25
  - id: police_intercept
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Kilo three. I'm cutting across to block the next junction.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 05d8ddf25dc984f25b315208a3c74e69, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 30
  - id: police_lost
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Dispatch, we've lost visual. All units, search the surrounding roads.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ea5f3ed4430b49fd9c7c6e6c8c24909, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 30
  - id: police_reacquired
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Visual reacquired. Suspect is back on the road. Close in.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c10d239f10284477db0cc3424578f6c4, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 30
  - id: police_coast
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: Suspect is out on the coast road. Follow them along the seawall. Watch the water.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46f6444dddaec48d79df18e88b306fa1, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  - id: police_close
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Police right on your tail. Keep moving, use the corners.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de7d7336e7e6f4595890512c74b91dae, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 45
  - id: police_lost_control
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: You're out of their sight. Stay off the main roads and they'll lose you.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe6b7ea2b1eb34d98acf88889c573a85, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 45
  - id: police_standdown
    speaker: PORT POLICE
    text: All units, suspect has left the port by sea. Stand down.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4942f075eddf24b1eae6d4c40e137861, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: crane_align
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: Gantry's moving. Spreader coming over KX-7. Hold still.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: befa2be155775429fb7a9d3477a275e4, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: crane_locked
    speaker: OVERWATCH
    text: All four corners locked. Taking the weight.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0658d3d175754eb2b8df4c305dd88ee, type: 3}
    priority: 0
    cooldown: 0
  - id: crane_delivered
    speaker: CONTROL
    text: KX-7 is on the crew truck. It leaves by the north gate once you're clear.
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 317b18a33d06440deb94b8cf70cb36a5, type: 3}
    priority: 1
    cooldown: 0
  voice: {fileID: 196609304}
  fx: {fileID: 1874784026}
  squelchIn: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a4f32b568deb14524bd50b496cd9aa82, type: 3}
  squelchOut: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 198c474f0bbb749b185125096298f6e4, type: 3}
